@startuml UC07_BookFlight
autonumber

actor "Passenger" as Passenger
participant "System" as Sys
database "Airport Database" as DB
participant "PaymentGateway" as PaymentGateway
participant "EmailProvider" as EmailProvider

Passenger -> Sys : Click "Book now" / Enter number of tickets
Sys -> Passenger : Ask passenger details, seating and luggage info
Passenger -> Sys : Submit all passenger details
Sys -> DB : Calculate final cost
DB --> Sys : Cost calculated
Sys -> Passenger : Ask for payment information
Passenger -> Sys : Submit payment information
Sys -> PaymentGateway : Process payment
PaymentGateway --> Sys : Payment approved
Sys -> DB : Reserve tickets / Create booking reference
Sys -> DB : Update passenger capacity
Sys -> EmailProvider : Send confirmation email
EmailProvider --> Sys : Email sent
Sys -> Passenger : Display success message with booking reference

@enduml